\begin{align*} (-2)\mathbf{d} &= \begin{pmatrix} -1 \\ -7 \end{pmatrix} \end{align*}Dividing both sides by $-2$, we get $\mathbf{d} = \begin{pmatrix} 0.5 \\ -3.5 \end{pmatrix}.$
